        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1.设向量  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\vec{a},\\vec{b}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 满足  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "|\\vec{a} -\\vec{b}| = |\\vec{a} +\\vec{b} |"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，则必有（）.A.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\vec{a} -\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " B.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\vec{a} +\\vec{b} = \\vec{0}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " C.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\vec{a}\\cdot \\vec{b} = 0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " D.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\vec{a}\\times \\vec{b} = \\vec{0}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                307,
                744,
                367
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2.二元函数  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "f(x,y)=2x-4y-x^{2}-2y^{2}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 的驻点是（）.\nA.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(-1,-1)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  B.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(1,-1)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  C.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "(-1,1)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  D.(1,1)"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                385,
                705,
                428
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3.函数  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "z = 3^{xy}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，则在点(1,1)处的全微分  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "dz = (\\quad)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " A.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "dx"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " B.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "dy"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " C.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "3(dx + dy)\\ln 3"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " D.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "dx + dy"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                441,
                727,
                485
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4.设C是按逆时针方向绕行的圆周曲线  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x^{2}+y^{2}=R^{2}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，则  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\oint_{C}xy^{2}dy-x^{2}ydx=(\\quad)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " .\nA.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}r^{3}dr"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  B.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}r^{2}dr"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " \nC.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "-\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}4r^{3}\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta dr"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  D.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{R}R^{2}dr"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                78,
                498,
                717,
                607
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5.下列正项级数中，收敛的是（）.\nA.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{5^{n}-3^{n}}{4^{n}}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  B.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{n}{2^{n}}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  C.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "  D.  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n+1}{n^{2}}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
